<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-19T17:37:21.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:37:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits are raiding villages and blocking a deputy governor convoy in Zamfara while gunmen shot the Miyetti Allah chairman in Plateau and assaulted police stations in Plateau, Abia and Borno, killing several officers. ISWAP militants placed landmines on a highway in Borno that killed eight soldiers and later claimed an attack that killed 21 soldiers and militiamen at an army base. President Tinubu approved security equipment to protect trains from bandit attacks and an air traffic controller remains captive after being abducted at Sokoto airport for 52 days. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE5LZWhPaC1pLVZPMVlYMzV0cUZJWmRpbC1mQ3hFSzBEczBFcFVadjdhemhzQ1VZYW1Wdi1FMGR3V3pRRFZZd3JyckE2SHpwT3VuM1F4VVBMVmxNMFV2S2c3UW1DX3N5MTQxbHY2bEptQ3E1OVd2UGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chronicle NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPdl9MVW5jM1BacEZZWVdENEVBY2p1WVJFSkQteG9GVDg4eHNqMlQzTENHLWxpRVhZXzBRSTh0Nm1JVVhCcmRHRzFhRFNQUjFIcElwdnlOWU5SVGQtT19FSW5TSWlDOGNfeGx5UTlrSGpEcnhDbEt2RkVDMnlFVVlCODc4aEpUeEtaUHUzc2VTS3FCejctNXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQUkxzM0xCc191NFk1MnNHc3lSUjR4NGRQelhZR1c2amc3LTZ3M01vTVo5amRsNDJ2UjFJMzNhbEJXUWtlZk5Qa0lyWXRnMlRScmxGN245VGNzWWtFU2NOR0EwX0xpeFdtQzRpTF9DLW9UNFpvcHNZWTFPaDI5STJDbGNFWlZGMUh2dm9RcERkWGMwbkZRNzljaGViM2lvSUJpbnc2RGRzY28yYnJVemc?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE4yOVVDeTQyRmx2SHc3QmF4d3RLaEtWcUlqWFN0RWJubFA3ZUFrWFJId1dhRFllZFVYQUVtT3lNRUttWTllOWd2cXpvODRkMGtGcjhLWXBMTmYwYXU0S2g4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQdm1Hbj